{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 35","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_35\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 35</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_35\">Problem 35</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 35\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the right triangle shown the sum of the distances <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/6/8068607716f3c2549af1dc978d77a422ca7201dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BM$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f7eb82948ac9d7e8659abb37508b1015d8a3cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MA$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" /> is equal to the sum of the distances <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/5/e657259c0995d2c36d46744bb4aa81471e6575ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CA$\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" />. \nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cbbfc9f795e155ba6d0fdbadeb8f3b2c2ee0348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MB = x, CB = h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/8/438570c12599e8aa1073fcca0acd3dac75eb3fff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CA = d$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/4/74443c59450d6418d3f8906d39a8a8f8165ecc4d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)+fontsize(10pt)); dotfactor=4; draw((0,0)--(8,0)--(0,5)--cycle); label(&quot;C&quot;,(0,0),SW); label(&quot;A&quot;,(8,0),SE); label(&quot;M&quot;,(0,5),N); dot((0,3.5)); label(&quot;B&quot;,(0,3.5),W); label(&quot;$x$&quot;,(0,4.25),W); label(&quot;$h$&quot;,(0,1),W); label(&quot;$d$&quot;,(4,0),S);[/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"432\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/d/f8d913025964333249feef7eb101eb71571285b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{hd}{2h+d}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ d-h\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}d\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ h+d-\\sqrt{2d}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\sqrt{h^2+d^2}-h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"626\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The question states that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a43c713a8b92925d9487ead830280f742f1052e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[h+d = x+\\sqrt{(x+h)^2+d^2}\\]\" width=\"220\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>We move <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to the left: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/d/7ed1a889dc2755602344782871501f72bb96e8a3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[h+d-x = \\sqrt{(x+h)^2+d^2}\\]\" width=\"220\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>We square both sides: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/9/47917f6be38007c91b9ecbbb37bd03cc09a29cb5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[h^2 + d^2 + x^2 - 2xh - 2xd + 2hd = x^2 + 2xh + h^2 + d^2\\]\" width=\"422\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Cancelling and moving terms, we get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/8/158be5737e538c7fae61acbefc76db6620d82289.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4xh + 2xd = 2hd\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Factoring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/0/650e677676c61a105fe3f0c56c47ec2f6ccb076c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(4h+2d) = 2hd\\]\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Isolating for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/7/36772b45940690f76778fea3b1099adbf30759b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{2hd}{4h+2d}=\\frac{hd}{2h+d}\\]\" width=\"176\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Realize that a 3 - 4 - 5 triangle satisfies these requirements. Checking the answer choices, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" /> is the correct solution.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME\" title=\"1954 AHSME\">1954 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1954 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1954\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Prob